   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "W-Well...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Yeah.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Back when I met Shiho,[n]when she saved me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I realized that personal[n]relationships are something[n]to be treasured.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "That's why I'm not going[n]to run away anymore.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I'll face myself head on.[n]This time, it's my turn[n]to help someone.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "But... I'm still kinda worried.[n]Do you think you could help[n]me, [fName]?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Of course.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "Звісно.[clr 27]",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ask me anything.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Mm-hm!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You can lean on me too, if you need it...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
