   "en": "I will.",
   "uk": "Так.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I already am.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Good!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "*giggle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...I feel like we finally see each[n]other eye to eye, [fName].",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I'm so glad I met you...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I feel a strong bond between me and Ann...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I can sense a new power growing within me!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "PFM_016_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ann's Persona [clr 1]Carmen[clr 27] has[n]transformed into [clr 2]Hecate[clr 27]!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Promise me that you'll[n]stay by my side... Okay?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Of course.",
   "uk": "Звісно.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I should be asking you that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
