   "en": "Good...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...I'm so glad.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "*giggle* Are you worried?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Maybe it's more fitting for[n]you to be chasing after me?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Kidding. I wouldn't be able to handle that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#3",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "To be honest... lately it's felt[n]lonely just waiting for the[n]next time I'll get to see you.",
